":\"732 829 320 00074\",\"microEntrepriseTip\":\"Did you know?\",\"microEntrepriseDesc\":\"Creating your micro-enterprise takes exactly 15 minutes and allows you to generate unlimited revenue on Naano.\",\"microEntrepriseFranceOnly\":\"For creators based in France only.\",\"downloadGuide\":\"Download the guide (PDF)\",\"needHelp\":\"Need help? Book a 15 min call with a Naano expert\",\"mandateSignature\":\"Terms and certification\",\"acceptTermsAndPrivacy\":\"I accept the \u003cterms\u003eTerms of Service\u003c/terms\u003e and \u003cprivacy\u003ePrivacy Policy\u003c/privacy\u003e.\",\"certifyAccuracy\":\"I certify on my honor the accuracy of the information provided.\",\"saving\":\"Saving...\",\"createCreatorProfile\":\"Create my creator profile\",\"stepperStep1Title\":\"Tell us who you are\",\"stepperStep1Subtitle\":\"Your identity, so brands can recognize you\",\"stepperStep1Social\":\"Join 500+ B2B creators already active on Naano\",\"stepperStep2Title\":\"Your LinkedIn presence\",\"stepperStep2Subtitle\":\"Connect your audience and your topics\",\"stepperStep2Social\":\"Creators with a complete profile get 3× more invitations\",\"stepperStep3Title\":\"Your public profile\",\"stepperStep3Subtitle\":\"What companies will see first\",\"stepperStep3Social\":\"Your personal data stays private and secure\",\"stepperStep4Title\":\"Almost there!\",\"stepperStep4Subtitle\":\"Choose your legal status and accept the terms\",\"stepperStep4Social\":\"100% of our creators receive their first payment within 48h\",\"audienceStepTitle\":\"Who follows you\",\"audienceStepSubtitle\":\"Tell us about your community so we can match you with SaaS that fit\",\"audienceStepSocial\":\"The better you describe your audience, the better the matches you get\",\"audienceIndustriesLabel\":\"Industries your followers work in\",\"audienceIndustriesHelper\":\"Pick all that apply. Helps us match you with brands targeting these audiences.\",\"audienceCompanySizeLabel\":\"Their company size\",\"audi