id after a short cooldown.\",\"directFlatHowItWorks3\":\"You set your own price and which packs you offer. You can pause anytime.\",\"directFlatPriceLabel\":\"Your price per post (€)\",\"directFlatPricePlaceholder\":\"300\",\"directFlatPriceHelper\":\"Net price you receive. €10 minimum.\",\"directFlatBundlesLabel\":\"Bundle options (optional, up to 2)\",\"directFlatBundlesHelper\":\"Discounted packs for multi-post bookings.\",\"directFlatBundlePostsPlaceholder\":\"Posts\",\"directFlatBundlePricePlaceholder\":\"Total price (€)\",\"directFlatAddBundle\":\"+ Add another bundle\",\"directFlatRemoveBundle\":\"Remove\",\"directFlatApplyCta\":\"Apply for Flat Fee\",\"directFlatSkipCta\":\"Skip for now\",\"directFlatSkipHelper\":\"You can still apply later from your dashboard.\",\"directFlatPriceMinError\":\"Minimum price is €10\",\"directFlatPriceSuggestion\":\"Suggested: €{amount} →\",\"directFlatBundleInvalidError\":\"Bundles need at least 2 posts and €10\",\"directFlatScrapeConsentLabel\":\"I agree that, if Naano approves my application, they may fetch my public LinkedIn profile.\",\"directFlatScrapeConsentError\":\"Please tick the consent box to send your application.\",\"directFlatApplyingCta\":\"Sending your application...\",\"directFlatAppliedTitle\":\"Application sent\",\"directFlatAppliedBody\":\"Our team reviews Flat Fee applications within 48 hours. We'll email you the decision.\",\"directFlatApplyError\":\"Couldn't send your application. You can try again from your dashboard.\",\"genericError\":\"Something went wrong. Please try again.\",\"companySectionTitle\":\"Company information\",\"companyLegalName\":\"Legal company name *\",\"companyLegalNamePlaceholder\":\"Acme SARL\",\"companyRegistrationCountry\":\"Country of Registration *\",\"companyTaxIdFrance\":\"SIRET *\",\"companyTaxIdUs\":\"EIN *\",\"companyTaxIdUk\":\"Company Number *\",\"companyTaxIdOther\":\"Tax / Commercial ID Number *\",\"companyTaxIdPlaceholderFrance\":\"732 829 320 00074\",\"companyTaxIdP