not stop the collaboration: {error}\",\"networkError\":\"Network error\",\"thisCreator\":\"this creator\"},\"walletHeaderWidget\":{\"availableShort\":\"available\",\"cpcShort\":\"Clicks\",\"flatShort\":\"Flat\",\"saasTitle\":\"Wallet · pay-per-click + flat-fee balances - open finances\",\"creatorTitle\":\"Wallet · available to withdraw - open finances\",\"saasTitleWithClicks\":\"Pay-per-click ≈ {count} clicks available · click to open finances\"},\"billingV2\":{\"loadingWallet\":\"Loading wallet...\",\"loadError\":\"Could not load wallet.\",\"retry\":\"Retry\",\"title\":\"Billing\",\"subtitle\":\"Add money once. Use it for creator bookings or pay-per-click campaigns.\",\"availableToSpendLabel\":\"Available to spend\",\"heroHeldLine\":\"{amount} more is held in active bookings and released to creators on publish.\",\"allocationTitle\":\"Set spending allocation\",\"allocationSub\":\"Move the slider to decide how much of your wallet goes to each spending mode.\",\"allocationPostLabel\":\"Pay per post\",\"allocationPostHint\":\"Flat-fee bookings draw on this.\",\"allocationClickHint\":\"€1.90 – €2.90 per qualified click*\",\"allocationClickLive\":\"{price} per qualified click*\",\"allocationTotalLabel\":\"total\",\"allocationHeldLabel\":\"Held in escrow\",\"allocationReset\":\"Reset\",\"allocationApply\":\"Apply allocation\",\"allocationApplying\":\"Moving…\",\"heroSub\":\"{total} total · split below\",\"heroHelp\":\"Use this balance for flat-fee creator bookings or pay-per-click campaigns. Move money between the two anytime.\",\"cpcEmptyHelp\":\"Move money here to launch pay-per-click campaigns.\",\"totalBalance\":\"Total balance\",\"addMoney\":\"Add money\",\"moveMoney\":\"Move money\",\"available\":\"Available\",\"readyToSpend\":\"Ready to spend\",\"availableHint\":\"Fund pay-per-click or book a creator from here.\",\"addMoneyAction\":\"+ Add money\",\"payPerClick\":\"Pay per click\",\"clicksLeft\":\"~{count} clicks left\",\"notFundedYet\":\"Not funded yet\",\"perQualifiedClick\":\"{amount} per qualified click\",\"moveMoneyHere\":\"Move money here to launch campaigns.\",\"moveMoneyAction\":\"Move money →\",\"inBookings\":\"In bookings\",\"activeBooking\":\"{count} active booking\",\"activeBookings\":\"{count} active bookings\",\"nothingReserved\":\"Nothing reserved\",\"bookingsHint\":\"Locked until the creator delivers, then released to them.\",\"flowAddMoney\":\"Add money\",\"flowAvailable\":\"Available\",\"flowSplitsInto\":\"splits into\",\"flowPayPerClick\":\"Pay per click\",\"flowOr\":\"or\",\"flowCreatorBookings\":\"creator bookings\",\"recentActivity\":\"Recent activity\",\"seeFullHistory\":\"See full history →\",\"noActivity\":\"No activity yet. Add money to your wallet to get started.\",\"entryMoneyAdded\":\"Money added\",\"entryCreditsConverted\":\"Credits converted to euros\",\"entryClickCharge\":\"Pay-per-click charge\",\"entryClickChargeReason\":\"Pay-per-click charge - {reason}\",\"entryBookingReserved\":\"Booking reserved\",\"entryBookingReservedReason\":\"Booking reserved - {reason}\",\"entryBookingDelivered\":\"Booking delivered\",\"entryBookingDeliveredReason\":\"Booking delivered - {reason}\",\"entryBookingRefunded\":\"Booking refunded\",\"entryBookingRefundedReason\":\"Booking refunded - {reason}\",\"entryMovedToCpc\":\"Moved to pay-per-click\",\"entryMovedBetween\":\"Moved between balances\",\"entryWithdrawn\":\"Withdrawn to bank\",\"entryAdjustment\":\"Adjustment\",\"bucketAvailable\":\"Available\",\"bucketPayPerClick\":\"Pay per click\",\"bucketFlatFee\":\"Flat fee\",\"bucketInBookings\":\"In bookings\",\"topupTitle\":\"Add money\",\"topupClose\":\"Close\",\"topupBody\":\"Money goes to your available balance. From there you can move some into pay-per-click, or let creator bookings draw on it.\",\"topupYouPay\":\"You pay\",\"topupLandsInWallet\":\"Lands in your wallet\",\"topupClicksEstimate\":\"Qualified clicks\",\"topupClicksAtRate\":\"at ~{price} per click (volume tier)\",\"topupPostsEstimate\":\"Creator posts\",\"topupPostsAtAvg\":\"at ~{price} per post (catalogue avg)\",\"topupMinimumError\":\"Minimum is €500.\",\"topupCancel\":\"Cancel\",\"topupRedirecting\":\"Redirecting...\",\"topupPayViaStripe\":\"Pay {amount} via Stripe\",\"topupCheckoutError\":\"Could not start checkout\",\"moveFundsTitle\":\"Move money\",\"moveFundsClose\":\"Close\",\"moveFundsIntro\":\"Your money stays in Naano, you're just choosing what it can be spent on.\",\"moveFundsWhatDo\":\"What do you want to do?\",\"moveFundsToCpcTitle\":\"Move into pay-per-click\",\"moveFundsToCpcSub\":\"Use available money to run click campaigns\",\"moveFundsToAvailableTitle\":\"Move back to available\",\"moveFundsToAvailableSub\":\"Free up unused click budget to spend or book\",\"moveFundsHowMuch\":\"How much?\",\"moveFundsEmptyBucket\":\"There's nothing in {bucket} to move yet.\",\"moveFundsMoveAll\":\"Move all\",\"moveFundsLabelAvailable\":\"Available\",\"moveFundsLabelPayPerClick\":\"Pay-per-click\",\"moveFundsB4Warning\":\"Move everything, or leave at least €220 in pay-per-click so a running campaign isn't stranded.\",\"moveFundsCancel\":\"Cancel\",\"moveFundsCta\":\"Move {amount} {direction}\",\"moveFundsCtaPlain\":\"Move\",\"moveFundsCtaToCpc\":\"to pay-per-click\",\"moveFundsCtaToAvailable\":\"to available\",\"moveFundsSubmitting\":\"Moving...\",\"moveFundsEnterAmount\":\"Enter an amount\",\"moveFundsOnlyHave\":\"You only have {amount} in {bucket}.\",\"moveFundsLeaveAtLeast\":\"Move everything, or leave at least €220 in pay-per-click so a running campaign isn't stranded. This would leave {amount}.\",\"moveFundsCpcEmpty\":\"Your pay-per-click budget is empty, move at least €580 to switch campaigns on.\",\"moveFundsTransferFailed\":\"Transfer failed\",\"availableLabel\":\"Available balance\",\"availableHelper\":\"Fund campaigns from here - pay-per-click or creator bookings.\",\"cpcLabel\":\"Pay-per-click*\",\"cpcHelper\":\"{rate} per qualified click\",\"heldLabel\":\"Held for flat-fee bookings\",\"heldHelperActive\":\"{count} active, released to the creator the moment they post.\",\"heldHelperEmpty\":\"Held in escrow while a creator is delivering your booking. Goes to the creator when they post, comes back to you on decline.\",\"explainerTitle\":\"How billing works\",\"explainerDismiss\":\"Dismiss\",\"explainerCpcTitle\":\"Pay-per-click\",\"explainerCpcBody\":\"Top up your wallet, then pay only for each qualified click your campaign earns.\",\"explainerFlatTitle\":\"Flat-fee (per post)\",\"explainerFlatBody\":\"A fixed price per post. When the creator accepts, the amount moves from your Flat Fee balance to Held for flat-fee bookings. The creator gets paid when they publish and submit the post URL.\",\"explainerExperts\":\"Want it done for you? Our experts can run the whole brief - from €790.\",\"cpcAsteriskNote\":\"** You only pay per qualified click. The more budget you move in, the lower the price per click (degressive pricing).\",\"moveFundsClicksEstimate\":\"≈ {count} qualified clicks\",\"moveFundsClicksRate\":\"{rate} per click* · degressive pricing\",\"moveFundsDegressiveNote\":\"* The more budget you move into pay-per-click, the lower the price per click.\",\"historyTitle\":\"Full history\",\"historyBack\":\"Back\",\"walletBalanceLabel\":\"Wallet balance\",\"walletBalanceSub\":\"Set a budget for each mode below. Use one, the other, or both. Adjust it anytime, and your money never expires.\",\"flatFeeTitle\":\"Flat Fee\",\"flatFeeDesc\":\"Fixed-price creator bookings.\",\"flatFeeBudgetLabel\":\"Budget for bookings\",\"cpcTitle\":\"Cost Per Click\",\"cpcRangeDesc\":\"€1.90 – €2.90 per qualified click.\",\"cpcClicksRange\":\"≈ {lo}–{hi} clicks\",\"cpcClicksExact\":\"{count} clicks · {rate} / click\",\"cpcNotFunded\":\"Not funded yet\",\"clearBtn\":\"Clear\",\"maxBtn\":\"Max\",\"upToAmount\":\"up to {amount}\",\"splitTitle\":\"How your wallet is split\",\"splitUnallocated\":\"Unallocated\",\"splitHeld\":\"In bookings\",\"splitAdjustNote\":\"Adjust anytime. No fees, no lock-in.\",\"applyChangesCta\":\"Apply changes\",\"budgetResetCta\":\"Reset\",\"budgetEmptyTitle\":\"Your wallet is empty\",\"budgetEmptyBody\":\"Add money to start setting budgets for bookings and pay-per-click.\"},\"proUpgrade\":{\"title\":\"Upgrade to a professional account\",\"subtitle\":\"Flat Fee bookings are invoiced to a registered business, so applying requires a professional account. Add your company details below to switch - it's instant.\",\"submitCta\":\"Become a professional account\",\"submitting\":\"Saving…\",\"successTitle\":\"You're now a professional account\",\"successBody\":\"You can now apply to Flat Fee. Your company details are saved and used for invoicing.\",\"cardTitle\":\"Professional account required\",\"cardBody\":\"Flat Fee requires a registered company for invoicing. Switch to a professional account to apply.\",\"cardCta\":\"Become a professional\",\"infoTitle\":\"Company information\",\"infoSubtitle\":\"Used to invoice your Flat Fee bookings. Keep it up to date.\",\"editCta\":\"Edit\",\"saveCta\":\"Save changes\",\"saving\":\"Saving…\",\"cancelCta\":\"Cancel\"},\"matching\":{\"regionIntro\":\"{region}, pick countries to narrow, or leave blank to match the whole region\",\"addOtherSector\":\"+ Other sector\",\"otherSectors\":\"Other sectors\",\"otherSectorPlaceholder\":\"e.g. Telecom, Automotive, Real Estate…\",\"addSectorBtn\":\"Add\",\"removeSectorAria\":\"Remove {name}\",\"addCountryNotListed\":\"+ Add a country not listed\",\"otherCountries\":\"Other countries\",\"showLess\":\"Show less\",\"showMore\":\"+{count} more\",\"cancel\":\"Cancel\",\"removeCountryAria\":\"Remove {name}\"},\"flatProfile\":{\"profileLockedTitle\":\"Your profile page unlocks with Pay per post\",\"profileLockedBody\":\"The public profile page is for creators accepted into the Pay per post program, where companies book you for a flat fee per LinkedIn post. Apply from your dashboard to get access.\",\"profileLockedPendingBody\":\"Your Pay per post application is being reviewed. Your profile page unlocks as soon as you're accepted, we'll let you know.\",\"profileLockedCta\":\"Back to my dashboard\",\"yourProfileFallback\":\"Your profile\",\"headingCard\":\"My creator card\",\"headingEdit\":\"Your profile\",\"headingPreview\":\"Company preview\",\"introEdit\":\"This is how companies see you. Auto-built from your LinkedIn: drag to reorder, hide what you don't want, and add your own sections.\",\"introPreview\":\"This is exactly what companies see when they open your profile in the catalogue.\",\"viewModeAria\":\"View mode\",\"tabCard\":\"My card\",\"tabEdit\":\"Edit\",\"tabPreview\":\"Preview\",\"changePhoto\":\"Change profile photo\",\"pulledFromLinkedin\":\"Imported through the creator’s LinkedIn connection\",\"analyticsUnverifiedShort\":\"connection verified · figures not independently audited\",\"analyticsUnverified\":\"Naano verified the extension connection and sync. The figures themselves are not independently audited.\",\"verifiedProvenance\":\"Private LinkedIn analytics synced\",\"basicProvenance\":\"Public profile data · reach is estimated\",\"syncedSuffix\":\" · synced {date}\",\"pauseBookingsAria\":\"Pause bookings\",\"resumeBookingsAria\":\"Resume bookings\",\"acceptingBookings\":\"Accepting bookings\",\"paused\":\"Paused\",\"availableToBook\":\"Available to book\",\"marketplacePrivate\":\"Private Marketplace card\",\"marketplacePrivateHint\":\"You can complete your card and price now. It becomes bookable after commercial approval and professional setup.\",\"sectionAbout\":\"About\",\"sectionAudience\":\"Audience \u0026 average metrics\",\"sectionPosts\":\"Recent posts\",\"sectionEngagers\":\"Who engages with you\",\"sectionPricing\":\"Pricing\",\"sectionFallback\":\"Section\",\"dragToReorderTitle\":\"Drag to reorder\",\"editSectionAria\":\"Edit section\",\"editDescriptionAria\":\"Edit description\",\"choosePostsAria\":\"Choose posts\",\"hideSectionAria\":\"Hide section\",\"deleteSectionAria\":\"Delete section\",\"addASection\":\"Add a section\",\"hiddenSectionsHeading\":\"Hidden sections\",\"hiddenSectionsEmpty\":\"Sections you hide move here. Click one to add it back.\",\"showSectionAgainTitle\":\"Show this section again\",\"noCompaniesYet\":\"No companies added yet.\",\"emptySection\":\"Empty section.\",\"followers\":\"Followers\",\"impressions28d\":\"Impressions · 90 days\",\"avgImpressions\":\"Avg impressions/post\",\"impressionsCoverage\":\"Posts measured\",\"avgViews\":\"Est. median reach\",\"avgViewsNote\":\"Median estimated reach from public LinkedIn posts (Apify). Private impressions appear after the creator connects the Naano extension.\",\"avgReactions\":\"Avg reactions\",\"avgComments\":\"Avg comments\",\"engagement\":\"Engagement\",\"basedIn\":\"Based in\",\"linkedinAudienceBreakdown\":\"LinkedIn audience analytics\",\"audienceCategory_location\":\"Location\",\"audienceCategory_company_size\":\"Company size\",\"audienceCategory_seniority\":\"Seniority\",\"audienceCategory_job_title\":\"Job title\",\"audienceCategory_industry\":\"Industry\",\"audienceCategory_company\":\"Company\",\"importRunningTitle\":\"LinkedIn update in progress\",\"importRunningBody\":\"The import is continuing in the background — {progress}%.\",\"importPartialTitle\":\"Partial LinkedIn import\",\"importPartialBody\":\"{measured}/{expected} posts returned real impressions. Missing values are not replaced with estimates.\",\"importProblemTitle\":\"Your LinkedIn update needs attention\",\"importProblemBody\":\"Open help to see the diagnostic or report the issue.\",\"importHelpAria\":\"LinkedIn import help\",\"importHelpTitle\":\"Problem with your LinkedIn analytics?\",\"importHelpBody\":\"We automatically attach the job, stage, and technical version — never your LinkedIn cookie.\",\"importDiagnostic\":\"Job {id} · status {status} · stage {phase}\",\"importHelpPlaceholder\":\"Describe what you see or what is missing…\",\"importHelpSubmit\":\"Send diagnostic\",\"importHelpSending\":\"Sending…\",\"importHelpSent\":\"Sent. We now have the technical context we need.\",\"syncCardTitle\":\"LinkedIn data\",\"syncStatusVerified\":\"Verified sync\",\"syncStatusPartial\":\"Partial sync\",\"syncStatusRunning\":\"Update in progress\",\"syncStatusPublicProfile\":\"Public profile · unverified\",\"syncStatusNotConnected\":\"Connection to complete\",\"syncLastUpdate\":\"Last update\",\"syncMeasuredPosts\":\"Posts measured\",\"syncRefreshCta\":\"Refresh my data\",\"syncPublicRefreshCta\":\"Refresh my public profile\",\"syncRefreshing\":\"Refreshing…\",\"syncPublicQueued\":\"Update started. Your card’s public information will refresh shortly.\",\"syncErrorMissingLinkedInUrl\":\"Add your LinkedIn profile URL in Settings first.\",\"syncErrorPublicRateLimited\":\"You have already refreshed your profile this week.\",\"syncErrorMissingExtension\":\"The Naano extension was not detected in this browser.\",\"syncErrorOutdatedExtension\":\"Reload the latest Naano extension and try again.\",\"syncErrorLinkedInSession\":\"We could not identify your LinkedIn session. Check that you are signed in to LinkedIn.\",\"syncErrorGeneric\":\"The update could not start. Try again in a moment.\",\"close\":\"Close\",\"audiencePending\":\"First stats land ~3 hours after this creator's next post.\",\"audienceLocked\":\"Audience stats unlock once this creator completes their professional profile and we scrape their recent posts.\",\"postsPending\":\"Recent posts will appear here within a few hours of this creator's next post.\",\"notEnoughEngagementData\":\"Not enough engagement data yet to break down the audience.\",\"engagersIntro\":\"Who likes and comments on this creator's posts, inferred from their LinkedIn titles.\",\"bySeniority\":\"By seniority\",\"byFunction\":\"By function\",\"seniorityFounder\":\"Founder / C-level\",\"seniorityVp\":\"VP / Head / Director\",\"seniorityManager\":\"Manager / Lead\",\"senioritySenior\":\"Senior IC\",\"seniorityOther\":\"Other\",\"functionFounders\":\"