. We'll follow up by email.\",\"postSlotApprovedBanner\":\"Brand approved your draft.\",\"postSlotSubmitExplanation\":\"Posting your LinkedIn URL releases {amount} to your wallet instantly. No cooldown.\",\"postSlotCancelledHint\":\"No action needed.\",\"postSlotDisputedHint\":\"Payment is on hold pending dispute resolution.\",\"loading\":\"Loading your bookings...\",\"loadError\":\"Could not load bookings.\",\"emptyTitle\":\"No bookings yet\",\"emptyBody\":\"When a company books you for a fixed-price post, it lands here. You accept, publish on LinkedIn, then submit your link to get paid.\",\"statusPending\":\"Pending your response\",\"statusAwaitingPost\":\"Awaiting your post\",\"statusInCooldown\":\"In cooldown\",\"statusPaidOut\":\"Paid out\",\"statusCancelled\":\"Cancelled\",\"statusRefunded\":\"Refunded\",\"statusInDispute\":\"In dispute\",\"companyFallback\":\"Company\",\"bookedYou\":\"Booked you for a fixed-price post\",\"brief\":\"Message\",\"youEarn\":\"You earn\",\"fixedPriceCaption\":\"fixed price · paid when you publish\",\"postBy\":\"Post by\",\"relativeDaysAgo\":\"{count, plural, =1 {1 day ago} other {# days ago}}\",\"relativeYesterday\":\"yesterday\",\"relativeToday\":\"today\",\"relativeTomorrow\":\"tomorrow\",\"relativeInDays\":\"{count, plural, =1 {in 1 day} other {in # days}}\",\"yourPostLabel\":\"Your post:\",\"viewOnLinkedIn\":\"View on LinkedIn ↗\",\"decline\":\"Decline\",\"acceptBooking\":\"Accept booking\",\"submitForValidation\":\"Submit your post to complete the collaboration\",\"postUrlPlaceholder\":\"https://linkedin.com/posts/...\",\"submit\":\"Submit\",\"submitExplanation\":\"Paste the LinkedIn URL of the post you published. As soon as you submit, your {amount} is released to your wallet.\",\"cooldownBanner\":\"\u003cstrong\u003e{amount}\u003c/strong\u003e is in cooldown until {date}. It moves to Available automatically.\",\"showMore\":\"Show more\",\"showLess\":\"Show less\",\"messageCompany\":\"Message company\",\"ctaRespond\":\"Respond\",\"ctaSendDraft\":\"Send draft\",\"ctaDraftInReview\":\"View draft\",\"ctaSubmitPost\":\"Submit post\",\"ctaView\":\"View\",\"ctaSeeBrief\":\"See details\",\"viewFullBrief\":\"View full brief\",\"viewFullBriefHint\":\"Opens the brief {company} built in their Studio (angles, posts, resources).\",\"briefFrom\":\"Brief from {company}\",\"startedOn\":\"Started\",\"draftToggleTitle\":\"Send your post text for {company} to approve\",\"draftRevisionTitle\":\"Revise your post text for {company}\",\"draftToggleHint\":\"Tap to expand and write the post you'll publish.\",\"draftToggleHintSubmitted\":\"Tap to see what you sent and the status of the review.\",\"tabActive\":\"In progress\",\"tabChangesRequested\":\"Changes requested\",\"tabSent\":\"Sent\",\"tabReceived\":\"Received\",\"tabArchived\":\"Archived\",\"filterAllSaas\":\"All brands\",\"emptyActiveTitle\":\"No active collaborations\",\"emptyActiveBody\":\"Bookings you've accepted and are working on will show up here.\",\"emptySentTitle\":\"No applications sent\",\"emptySentBody\":\"When you apply to a brand from the marketplace, your application shows up here until they respond.\",\"emptyReceivedTitle\":\"No new invites\",\"emptyReceivedBody\":\"When a brand books you for a fixed-price post, you'll see it here to accept or decline.\",\"emptyArchivedTitle\":\"Nothing archived yet\",\"emptyArchivedBody\":\"Completed, cancelled, and expired collaborations land here.\",\"emptyChangesTitle\":\"No changes requested\",\"emptyChangesBody\":\"When a brand asks you to revise a post draft, you'll see it here so you can edit and resubmit.\",\"youApplied\":\"You applied to this brand\",\"appliedOn\":\"Applied on\",\"withdrawApplication\":\"Withdraw\",\"cancelling\":\"Cancelling…\",\"appStatusPending\":\"Waiting on brand\",\"appStatusAccepted\":\"Accepted\",\"appStatusDeclined\":\"Declined\",\"appStatusCancelled\":\"Withdrawn\",\"appStatusExpired\":\"Expired\",\"statusDraftInReview\":\"Draft in review\",\"statusChangesRequested\":\"Changes requested\",\"statusAwaitingDraft\":\"Post approval needed\",\"draftStepTitle\":\"Submit your post text for {company} to approve\",\"draftPlaceholder\":\"Write the post you'll publish on LinkedIn…\",\"draftHint\":\"This company asked to review your post before it goes live. Send the text first - you'll publish and paste the link once it's approved.\",\"draftSubmitButton\":\"Submit for approval\",\"draftSubmitting\":\"Sending…\",\"inlineApprovedBanner\":\"Your text was approved by {company}.\",\"inlineApprovedBannerRest\":\"Publish it on LinkedIn, then paste the post link below to get your payout.\",\"inlineSubmitGet\":\"Submit post · get {amount}\",\"inlineSubmitting\":\"Submitting…\",\"inlinePayoutHint\":\"Your payout lands in your wallet as soon as the link is submitted.\",\"inlinePublishHint\":\"Publish on LinkedIn, then paste the post link. Your payout lands in your wallet as soon as the link is submitted.\",\"draftSubmittedTitle\":\"Text submitted to {company}\",\"draftSubmittedHint\":\"Waiting for {company} to review. You'll be able to publish and submit your link once it's approved.\",\"draftChangesTitle\":\"Changes requested\",\"contentApprovedBanner\":\"{company} approved your text - now publish it and paste the link below.\",\"earnHeadline\":\"Earn {amount} for one LinkedIn post\",\"statusLabel\":\"Status\",\"sublineRespond\":\"Respond before {date} to lock in this booking.\",\"sublineDraftNeeded\":\"Submit your post text for {company} to approve before you publish.\",\"sublineDraftSubmitted\":\"Your draft is with {company} for approval.\",\"sublineDraftChanges\":\"{company} asked for changes - update your draft and resend.\",\"sublineApproved\":\"Approved! Publish your post, then paste the link below.\",\"sublinePublish\":\"Post before {date} to unlock your payout.\",\"sublineCooldown\":\"Delivered - your payout unlocks after the cooldown.\",\"sublinePaid\":\"This collaboration is complete and paid out.\",\"summaryNeedsReply\":\"Needs your reply\",\"summaryActive\":\"Active\",\"summaryPendingPayout\":\"Pending payout\",\"summaryEarned\":\"Earned\",\"badgePendingAcceptance\":\"Pending acceptance\",\"badgeDraftInReview\":\"Draft in review\",\"badgeChangesRequested\":\"Changes requested\",\"badgeTextNeeded\":\"Post approval needed\",\"badgeAwaitingPost\":\"Awaiting your post\",\"badgeDelivered\":\"Delivered\",\"badgePaidOut\":\"Paid out\",\"badgeInDispute\":\"In dispute\",\"badgeClosed\":\"Closed\",\"tilePendingTitle\":\"Pending\",\"tilePendingHint\":\"Accept or decline below\",\"tileDraftInReviewTitle\":\"In review\",\"tileDraftInReviewHint\":\"Awaiting approval\",\"tileChangesRequestedTitle\":\"Changes requested\",\"tileChangesRequestedHint\":\"Update \u0026 resend\",\"tileTextNeededTitle\":\"Post approval needed\",\"tileTextNeededHint\":\"Send draft for approval\",\"tileAwaitingPostTitle\":\"Awaiting post\",\"tileAwaitingPostHint\":\"Submit your LinkedIn URL\",\"tileInCooldownTitle\":\"In cooldown\",\"tileInCooldownHint\":\"Payout unlocking\",\"tilePaidOutTitle\":\"Paid out\",\"tilePaidOutHint\":\"Completed\",\"tileInDisputeTitle\":\"In dispute\",\"tileInDisputeHint\":\"Under review\",\"tileClosedTitle\":\"Closed\",\"tabAll\":\"All\",\"tabEmpty\":\"Nothing in this view yet.\"},\"directCard\":{\"avgViewsPerPost\":\"est. avg views/post\",\"audience\":\"Audience\"},\"directMessaging\":{\"blocked\":{\"email\":\"This message contains contact details. Keep conversations on Naano so you stay covered by the platform.\",\"phone\":\"This message contains a phone number. Keep conversations on Naano so you stay covered by the platform.\",\"url\":\"This message contains an external link that isn't allowed. Only share Naano or LinkedIn links here.\",\"keyword\":\"This message mentions an external messaging service. All communication must stay on Naano.\",\"off_platform\":\"This message looks like it's proposing to deal outside Naano. Briefs, conversations and payments must stay on the platform.\",\"obfuscated_contact\":\"This message looks like it's sharing contact details. Keep conversations on Naano so you stay covered by the platform.\",\"duplicate\":\"You just sent an identical message. Please wait before resending it.\"},\"threadTitle\":\"Booking conversation\",\"emptyState\":\"No messages yet. Say hello to kick off this collaboration.\"},\"linkedinConsent\":{\"title\":\"Sync your LinkedIn in 1 second\",\"body\":\"Naano reads only your public posts to auto-fill your profile and your stats. That's it. No password, no DMs, nothing private - and you can disconnect anytime.\",\"reassurance\":\"It's a 1-second action, not a login. We never see your password or your messages.\",\"connectedTitle\":\"LinkedIn synced\",\"connectedBody\":\"Naano keeps your public profile and post stats up to date to power your collaboration analytics. You can disconnect anytime.\",\"lastRefreshed\":\"Last refreshed {when}\",\"connectCta\":\"Sync in 1 second\",\"disconnectCta\":\"Disconnect\",\"genericError\":\"Something went wrong\"},\"publicCreatorProfile\":{\"ctaTitle\":\"Want to work with {name}?\",\"ctaBody\":\"Book this creator for a LinkedIn post on Naano - fixed price, you keep full creative alignment, they keep their voice.\",\"ctaButton\":\"Get started on Naano\",\"ctaPoint1\":\"Fixed price per post\",\"ctaPoint2\":\"Keeps their authentic voice\",\"ctaPoint3\":\"Booked \u0026 paid on Naano\",\"whatIsNaanoTitle\":\"What is Naano\",\"whatIsNaanoBody\":\"Naano is the B2B LinkedIn creator marketplace: companies discover and book vetted creators, from niche voices with around 1,000 followers to established names with hundreds of thousands, for sponsored LinkedIn posts. Brands brief creators, creators publish authentic posts in their own voice, and every post is booked at a fixed price shown upfront.\",\"modelFlatLabel\":\"Flat fee per post\",\"modelFlatBody\":\"Book a creator at the fixed price on their offer, shown with deliverables before you commit. No retainer.\",\"modelCpcLabel\":\"Tracked results\",\"modelCpcBody\":\"Every post carries tracked links, so you see the clicks and leads each creator drives. The price stays fixed per post - no cost per click.\",\"browseCreatorsLink\":\"Browse all creators\",\"brandTagline\":\"The B2B LinkedIn creator marketplace\"},\"directBookingDetail\":{\"bundleHeading\":\"Bundle: {count} posts\",\"bundleSubheadingNeedsReview\":\"{count} draft awaiting your review.\",\"bundleSubheadingProgress\":\"{delivered} of {total} posts delivered. Total: {amount}.\",\"bundleProgressPill\":\"{delivered} of {total} delivered\",\"loadingPosts\":\"Loading posts...\",\"loadingPostsError\":\"Could not load posts. Try refreshing.\",\"postSlotHeader\":\"Post {index} of {total}\",\"postSlotBadgeAwaitingDraft\":\"Awaiting creator draft\",\"postSlotBadgeNeedsReview\":\"Needs your review\",\"postSlotBadgeChangesRequested\":\"Changes requested\",\"postSlotBadgeApprovedAwaitingUrl\":\"Approved, awaiting URL\",\"postSlotBadgeAwaitingUrl\":\"Awaiting URL\",\"postSlotBadgeDelivered\":\"Done\",\"postSlotBadgeCancelled\":\"Cancelled\",\"postSlotBadgeDisputed\":\"Disputed\",\"postSlotCopyAwaitingDraft\":\"The creator hasn't sent a draft for this post yet. You'll get notified when they do.\",\"postSlotCopyNeedsReview\":\"The creator submitted a draft. Approve to let them publish, or request changes with feedback.\",\"postSlotCopyChangesRequested\":\"You asked for changes. Waiting on the creator to revise and resubmit.\",\"postSlotCopyApprovedAwaitingUrl\":\"You approved this draft. Waiting on the creator to publish. {amount} releases when they do.\",\"postSlotCopyAwaitingUrl\":\"Waiting on the creator to publish this post. {amount} releases when they submit the LinkedIn URL.\",\"postSlotCopyDelivered\":\"Delivered. {amount} has been released to the creator.\",\"postSlotCopyCancelled\":\"This post slot was cancelled. The amount was refunded to your balance.\",\"postSlotCopyDisputed\":\"A dispute is open on this delivered post.\",\"postSlotCancelledHint\":\"No action needed.\",\"postSlotDisputedHint\":\"We'll follow up by email.\",\"approveDraft\":\"Approve draft\",\"requestChanges\":\"Request changes\",\"sendFeedback\":\"Send feedback\",\"cancel\":\"Cancel\",\"feedbackPlaceholder\":\"What needs to change?\",\"yourFeedback\":\"Your feedback\",\"youApprovedThisDraft\":\"You approved this draft.\",\"postedAt\":\"Published at:\",\"viewOnLinkedIn\":\"View on LinkedIn\",\"backToCollabs\":\"All collaborations\",\"followers\":\"followers\",\"messageCreator\":\"Message creator\",\"briefHeader\":\"Brief\",\"briefEmpty\":\"No brief provided.\",\"metricCost\":\"Cost\",\"metricReactions\":\"Reactions\",\"metricComments\":\"Comments\",\"metricImpressions\":\"Impressions\",\"metricPosts\":\"Posts\",\"metricReposts\":\"Reposts\",\"metricPostedOn\":\"Posted on\",\"metricStatus\":\"Status\",\"engagerIndustries\":\"Engager industries\",\"engagerSeniority\":\"Engager seniority\",\"engagerTopCompanies\":\"Top engager companies\",\"engagerComingSoon\":\"We're scraping the engagers now. Refresh in a few minutes.\",\"engagerNotEnough\":\"Not enough engagement data yet.\",\"recentPostHeader\":\"Post\",\"postNotYetSubmitted\":\"The creator hasn't submitted their post yet.\",\"postScrapeQueued\":\"Post submitted. We're fetching the metrics from LinkedIn.\",\"reach\":\"reach\",\"lastScraped\":\"Last scraped {date}\",\"today\":\"today\",\"dayAgoOne\":\"1d ago\",\"dayAgoOther\":\"{count}d ago\",\"statusPending\":\"In progress\",\"statusCounterProposed\":\"Counter-proposed\",\"statusInProgress\":\"In progress\",\"statusDelivered\":\"Delivered\",\"statusCompleted\":\"Completed\",\"statusCancelled\":\"Cancelled\",\"statusDeclined\":\"Declined\",\"statusDisputed\":\"Disputed\",\"statusExpired\":\"Expired\",\"statusRefunded\":\"Refunded\"},\"directBookings\":{\"reactionsLabel\":\"Reactions\",\"costLabel\":\"Cost\",\"cardImpressionsValue\":\"{value} est. impressions\",\"cardImpressionsMuted\":\"Impressions -\",\"commentsValue\":\"Comments {value}\",\