 failed.\",\"deliveryCompleted\":\"Deliveries completed\",\"deliveryStillPending\":\"Some deliveries are still pending. You can retry them.\",\"deliveryRetryNetwork\":\"Network error while retrying deliveries.\",\"deliveryPendingReview\":\"{n} delivery result(s) are pending. Use Retry to try again.\",\"insufficientBudgetNoInvites\":\"Insufficient budget. Save as draft or add funds. No invitations were sent.\",\"briefMissing\":\"Brief not found. Return to brief approval.\",\"campaignDraftSaved\":\"Campaign saved as a draft. No invitations were sent.\",\"sharePreparingLink\":\"Preparing the link…\",\"shareNoBrief\":\"Approve the brief before sharing the campaign.\",\"shareOpenFailed\":\"Could not open the share link.\",\"shareCampaignLinkCopied\":\"Campaign brief link copied.\",\"shareCreateFailed\":\"Could not create the share link.\",\"sharePreparing\":\"Preparing the share…\",\"dashboardReordered\":\"Dashboard reorganized · {count} change(s)\",\"dashboardCommandUnknown\":\"Command not understood — try “campaigns first” or “hide top creators”\",\"updateFailed\":\"Update failed\",\"writeChangesInChat\":\"Write the changes in the chat, then send\",\"postsExported\":\"{n} Posts exported\",\"featuresMax\":\"You can add up to 12 features\",\"interviewFail\":\"The AI interview is unavailable.\",\"interviewNet\":\"The connection was interrupted during the interview.\",\"objectiveFirst\":\"Describe your campaign objective first.\",\"generationUnavailable\":\"Campaign generation is unavailable right now.\",\"importUnavailable\":\"Brief import is unavailable right now.\",\"counterAcceptedFunding\":\"Counter accepted — top up to fund the collab\",\"counterAccepted\":\"Counter accepted — collab in Creating\",\"counterConfirmed\":\"Counter confirmed\",\"counterRefused\":\"Counter refused\",\"creativeFreedomSetupFailed\":\"We could not prepare creative freedom. Try again.\",\"cardBookingCompleted\":\"Card payment confirmed. Your creator invitation has been sent.\",\"cardCreditedWallet\":\"Payment confirmed, but the invitation could not be created. The full amount is available in your wallet.\",\"cardReconciliationNeeded\":\"This card payment needs review. Your wallet and invitation are protected while Naano reconciles it.\",\"cardPaymentProcessing\":\"Your card payment is still being confirmed. Refresh this page in a moment.\",\"cardCheckoutCancelled\":\"Card checkout cancelled. No invitation was sent.\",\"cardCheckoutCancelFailed\":\"We could not confirm the cancellation yet. Refresh and try again.\"},\"funding\":{\"title\":\"Add budget to start\",\"body\":\"Pay the collaboration amount now. Your available balance stays in your wallet.\",\"required\":\"Collaboration\",\"available\":\"Balance kept in wallet\",\"addNow\":\"Pay now\",\"waitingNote\":\"You will confirm the payment on Stripe. If you close it, the collaboration stays on hold.\",\"notNow\":\"Later\",\"continuePayment\":\"Continue to payment · {amount}\",\"creatorFallback\":\"this creator\"},\"confirm\":{\"acceptApplication\":\"Accept this application and create the booking?\",\"acceptCounter\":\"Accept this counter-offer?\",\"decline\":\"Confirm decline?\",\"declineSelected\":\"Confirm decline of {count}?\",\"refuseCounter\":\"Refuse this counter-offer?\"},\"status\":{\"app\":{\"label\":\"Application received\",\"help\":\"A creator applied to your program. Accept to create the booking (funds held in escrow) or decline. Without a response, the application eventually expires.\"},\"await\":{\"label\":\"Invitation sent · awaiting creator\",\"help\":\"Invitation sent - waiting for the creator to respond. Nothing to do on your side; without a reply before the deadline, it expires and nothing is charged.\",\"short\":\"Awaiting creator\"},\"counter\":{\"short\":\"Counter to confirm\"},\"funding\":{\"label\":\"Top up your budget\",\"help\":\"Your balance does not cover this booking - top up your budget in Billing to start the collaboration. Until then, the creator cannot begin.\"},\"accepted\":{\"label\":\"Awaiting the post\",\"help\":\"The creator accepted and is preparing their post. Funds stay in escrow until publication.\"},\"accepted_draft\":{\"label\":\"Awaiting the draft\",\"help\":\"The creator accepted and is writing their draft. You will review it before anything is published; funds stay in escrow.\"},\"draft\":{\"label\":\"Draft to review\",\"help\":\"A draft is awaiting your approval before publishing (enabled on this booking). Without a response, the creator is blocked.\"},\"changes\":{\"label\":\"Changes requested\",\"help\":\"You requested changes - waiting for the creator’s new draft. Nothing to do until they resubmit.\"},\"live\":{\"label\":\"Posted\",\"help\":\"The post is published. The creator payment is released at publication.\"},\"done\":{\"label\":\"Completed\",\"help\":\"Collaboration finished - creator payment released.\"},\"declined\":{\"label\":\"Declined\",\"help\":\"The creator declined this invitation. Nothing was charged.\"},\"disputed\":{\"label\":\"Disputed\",\"help\":\"Dispute being handled by the Naano team.\"},\"refunded\":{\"label\":\"Refunded\",\"help\":\"Booking refunded to your balance.\"},\"expired\":{\"label\":\"Expired\",\"help\":\"No delivery before the deadline. Nothing was charged - any escrowed funds were returned to your balance.\"},\"cancelled\":{\"label\":\"Cancelled\",\"help\":\"This booking was cancelled. Any escrowed funds were returned to your balance.\"}},\"agency\":{\"managing\":\"Managing\",\"backPortfolio\":\"Back to portfolio\",\"backDashboard\":\"Back to agency dashboard\",\"addCompany\":\"Add company\"},\"nav\":{\"overview\":\"Overview\",\"agencyPortfolio\":\"Agency portfolio\",\"clientDashboard\":\"Open client dashboard\",\"workspace\":\"Workspace\",\"collapse\":\"Collapse\",\"marketplace\":\"Creators\",\"billing\":\"Billing\",\"integrations\":\"Integrations\",\"createCampaign\":\"+ Create campaign\",\"allCampaigns\":\"All campaigns\",\"collaborations\":\"Collaborations\",\"leads\":\"Leads \u0026 Analytics\",\"messages\":\"Messages\",\"campaigns\":\"Campaigns\",\"results\":\"Results\"},\"marketplace\":{\"experienceLabel\":\"Creator discovery mode\",\"naoGettingStarted\":\"Yes — here’s a useful way to get started with Naano.\\n\\n• Give Nao a concrete brief: your product, target audience, countries and total budget.\\n• Review creators’ actual content first, then compare post prices and estimated median views or CPM. Those metrics do not guarantee sales.\\n• Save the profiles you like, then refine the selection in this chat — for example, ask for more creators or a different country.\\n• Prepare a campaign brief before booking. Start with a focused campaign and use the results to decide what to repeat.\",\"experienceAi\":\"AI Matching\",\"experienceMarketplace\":\"Creator Marketplace\",\"lyaPageTitle\":\"AI creator matching\",\"lyaPageSub\":\"Describe the campaign. Nao will search, filter and explain the strongest creator matches.\",\"lyaHeroEyebrow\":\"Nao · Creator intelligence\",\"lyaHeroTitle\":\"Who are you looking for?\",\"lyaHeroAccent\":\"Ask Nao.\",\"lyaHeroBody\":\"Describe the audience, geography, creative direction or budget. Nao turns your request into a comparable creator shortlist.\",\"lyaWorkbenchSubtitle\":\"Creator intelligence workspace\",\"lyaNewSearch\":\"New research\",\"lyaAnalysisSummary\":\"3 analyses\",\"lyaWhileWorking\":\"Optional\",\"lyaQuickQuestion\":\"One quick question\",\"lyaSkipQuestion\":\"Skip\",\"lyaThinking\":\"Nao is thinking…\",\"lyaStepRequestShort\":\"Request\",\"lyaStepEvidenceShort\":\"Evidence\",\"lyaStepRankingShort\":\"Ranking\",\"lyaTraceNarrative\":\"Analysing your request and its constraints.\",\"lyaTraceEvidence\":\"Comparing semantic signals with creator performance.\",\"lyaTraceRanking\":\"Ranking the strongest eligible profiles.\",\"lyaSourceQuestion\":\"How did you hear about Naano?\",\"lyaSourceSearch\":\"Google / search\",\"lyaSourceFriend\":\"A friend or colleague\",\"lyaSourceAi\":\"AI assistant\",\"lyaSourceEvent\":\"Event\",\"lyaSourcePartner\":\"Agency or partner\",\"lyaSourceOther\":\"Other\",\"lyaCallQuestion\":\"Want to book a call while I finish the search?\",\"lyaCallYes\":\"Book a call\",\"lyaCallLater\":\"Not now\",\"lyaGoalQuestion\":\"What matters most for this campaign?\",\"lyaGoalLeads\":\"Qualified leads\",\"lyaGoalAwareness\":\"Brand awareness\",\"lyaGoalAuthority\":\"Category authority\",\"lyaMixQuestion\":\"Which creator mix should Nao favour next time?\",\"lyaMixEmerging\":\"Emerging voices\",\"lyaMixProven\":\"Proven reach\",\"lyaMixBalanced\":\"Balanced mix\",\"lyaTimingQuestion\":\"When are you planning to launch?\",\"lyaTimingWeek\":\"This week\",\"lyaTimingMonth\":\"This month\",\"lyaTimingExploring\":\"Still exploring\",\"lyaCalendarTitle\":\"Book directly with the Naano team\",\"lyaCalendarBody\":\"Choose a time without leaving your creator search.\",\"lyaCalendarLoading\":\"Loading available times…\",\"lyaCalendarOpen\":\"Open calendar in a new tab\",\"lyaCalendarClose\":\"Close calendar\",\"lyaModelNote\":\"GPT-5 mini for nuance · instant filters when possible\",\"lyaComposerHint\":\"Enter to send · Shift + Enter for a new line\",\"lyaStop\":\"Stop search\",\"lyaDisclaimer\":\"Nao can make mistakes. Check important information.\",\"lyaStartersLabel\":\"Suggested for you\",\"lyaStarterMotion\":\"Find 5 US creators with a bold motion-design style\",\"lyaStarterMotionMeta\":\"US · LinkedIn · Motion\",\"lyaStarterNew\":\"Show me promising new B2B SaaS creators\",\"lyaStarterNewMeta\":\"B2B SaaS · Emerging creators\",\"lyaStarterCpm\":\"US creators with CPM below €80 and strong median views\",\"lyaStarterCpmMeta\":\"US · CPM \u003c €80 · Median views\",\"lyaStarterDecision\":\"Who reaches cybersecurity decision-makers?\",\"lyaRun\":\"Run\",\"lyaResultsEyebrow\":\"Nao's selection\",\"lyaResultsTitle\":\"Creators selected for your request\",\"lyaFeedback\":\"Rate this selection\",\"lyaCopyResults\":\"Copy results\",\"lyaHelpful\":