dgetTitle\":\"Monthly influence budget\",\"closeList\":\"Close the list\",\"companyHint\":\"Identity, product story and size — used for AI briefs and how creators understand your brand.\",\"companyName\":\"Company name\",\"companyNamePh\":\"Your company\",\"companyTitle\":\"Company profile\",\"copyKey\":\"Copy the key\",\"copySnippet\":\"Copy the snippet\",\"descPh\":\"What your product does, for whom, and why it matters — 2 to 4 concrete sentences.\",\"icpHint\":\"Naano proposes your ICP from the website. It ranks Best matches — correct only if the scan is off.\",\"icpTitle\":\"Target: ICP\",\"industries\":\"Target industries\",\"installBody1\":\"Paste this snippet before\",\"installBody2\":\"on every page of your site, hardcoded or via Google Tag Manager. Visits attribute themselves; for sign-ups and purchases, call\",\"installBody3\":\"in your product only after the corresponding action succeeds. From the first event received, the status above switches to Active.\",\"conversionExamples\":\"Then call these only after the corresponding action succeeds:\",\"installOnce\":\"Install it once: it covers all your campaigns, past and future. The key is already embedded in the snippet above.\",\"installTitle\":\"Installation: 2 minutes\",\"pixelHint\":\"Links your creators' posts to what happens on your site.\",\"pixelSub\":\"Without the pixel you see clicks. With it, every visit, sign-up or purchase is attributed to the creator who generated it: this feeds your KPIs (visits, sign-ups, revenue, ROAS), your cost per lead and your campaign scoring.\",\"pxStep1\":\"A post drives a click\",\"pxStep1Sub\":\"The reader clicks the creator's tracked link and lands on your site.\",\"pxStep2\":\"The pixel recognizes the visit\",\"pxStep2Sub\":\"A lightweight script, 2 minutes to install, no sensitive data, attributes it to the right creator.\",\"pxStep3\":\"Your conversions flow back\",\"pxStep3Sub\":\"Visits, sign-ups and purchases appear in Leads \u0026 Posts, creator by creator.\