 do you want to launch your campaign?\",\"howToLaunchLead\":\"How do you want to launch your\",\"howToLaunchWord\":\"campaign\",\"howToLaunchEnd\":\"?\",\"recommended\":\"Recommended\",\"step1\":\"Describe your need\",\"step1Sub\":\"In one sentence, or start from a suggested goal. You can also import an existing brief.\",\"step2\":\"AI writes your brief\",\"step2Sub\":\"Naano reads your site and your goal, then proposes context, target, angles and post examples. Every section stays editable.\",\"step3\":\"Select your creators\",\"step3Sub\":\"We show you a shortlist ranked by relevance to your value proposition. You adjust the list freely.\",\"step4\":\"Launch your campaign\",\"step4Sub\":\"Invitations go out with your full brief. You can approve each post before publication, and you only pay for delivered posts.\",\"howToLaunchSub\":\"Choose your method. You can change everything before launch.\",\"teamSlot\":\"Today · 14:30 · 15 min\",\"teamTitle\":\"Launch free with the Naano team\",\"teamDesc\":\"A campaign manager turns your selection into a ready-to-launch campaign. You validate, they handle the rest.\",\"teamCta\":\"Book my onboarding  →\",\"aiOrb\":\"AI\",\"aiBubble\":\"I want to reach VP Sales in B2B SaaS in France.\",\"aiTime\":\"5 min\",\"aiCta\":\"Create with AI\",\"linkTime\":\"1 min\",\"linkTitle\":\"Start from your link\",\"linkDesc\":\"Paste an influence campaign you already ran: Naano reuses the brief and structure.\",\"linkChip\":\"Brief recovered\",\"linkCta\":\"Start from my link\",\"linkSubmit\":\"Create →\",\"linkRequired\":\"Add the link to your campaign\",\"linkSeed\":\"Rebuild a ready-to-launch Naano brief from this existing campaign / brief: \",\"launchFoot\":\"No commitment · Everything stays editable · The Naano team can take over anytime\",\"launchFoot1\":\"No commitment\",\"launchFoot2\":\"Everything stays editable\",\"launchFoot3\":\"The Naano team can take over anytime\",\"interviewThinkingShort\":\"Naano is preparing what comes next…