 each reading, the engagement gathered at that same age: the real reactions, comments and reposts counters. A counter LinkedIn did not expose stays a dash, never a zero, and none of them enters the CPM.\",\"reachEngagementPosts\":\"over {n} post(s)\",\"reachEngagementUnread\":\"Engagement not read\",\"reachReactions\":\"{n} reactions\",\"reachReposts\":\"{n} reposts\",\"reachSub\":\"Impressions read by the creator on their own LinkedIn post analytics. Nothing else is counted.\",\"reachTitle\":\"Verified reach\",\"reachToday\":\"Today\",\"reachTodayHelp\":\"Calendar view: the latest reading of each post, summed as of today. Useful to follow a live campaign, never comparable between campaigns.\",\"cpmFinal\":\"Final CPM\",\"cpmFinalNote\":\"Final: every committed post has a day-7 reading.\",\"cpmLabel\":\"CPM\",\"cpmPartial\":\"Partial CPM\",\"cpmPartialNote\":\"Some day-7 slots closed without a reading. This figure will not become final.\",\"cpmProvisional\":\"Provisional CPM\",\"cpmScope\":\"Based on {budget} of {committed} committed, across {measured} of {bookings} bookings.\",\"reachUnmeasured\":\"{n} post(s) carry no verified measurement. They are shown as missing, never as zero.\",\"changesRequestedShort\":\"Changes sent — waiting for the new version\",\"openLinkedInPost\":\"View on LinkedIn\",\"draftEmpty\":\"No draft content to review yet.\",\"creator\":\"creator\",\"selectCampaignFirst\":\"Open a campaign to view its details.\",\"anglesShort\":\"angles\",\"sectionsCompleted\":\"sections completed\",\"briefToComplete\":\"To complete\",\"briefOutline\":\"Brief outline\",\"briefContextHelp\":\"The central message every creator should understand.\",\"sectionFilled\":\"Completed\",\"audienceAndToneHelp\":\"Who to speak to, where, and in what voice.\",\"editorialRulesHelp\":\"The essential guardrails that keep content true to the brand.\",\"briefExamplesHelp\":\"Useful sources that frame the substance and format.\",\"stageChoice\":\"My selection\",\"stageChoiceHint\":\"Selected creators — not invited yet\",\"choiceNotInvited\":\"Selected · not invited yet\",\"removeFromChoice\":\"Remove\",\"choiceEmpty\":\"No creators in My selection yet.\",\"findCreators\":\"Find my creators\",\"choiceEmptyHelp\":\"Add creators from the marketplace — no invitation is sent until you launch.\",\"choiceSummary\":\"My selection\",\"launchCampaign\":\"Launch campaign\",\"choiceSaved\":\"My selection updated\",\"findCreatorsHint\":\"Select the creators to add to My selection, then confirm.\"},\"time\":{\"agoWrap\":\"{ago} ago\",\"daysAgo\":\"{n} d ago\",\"hoursAgo\":\"{n} h ago\",\"minsAgo\":\"{n} min ago\",\"yesterday\":\"yesterday\"},\"ws\":{\"create\":\"Create\",\"newPh\":\"New space name\",\"staffMore\":\"more clients, refine the search.\",\"staffNone\":\"No client found.\",\"staffNote\":\"You act on behalf of the selected client.\",\"staffSearch\":\"Search for a client…\",\"staffTitle\":\"Naano staff · act for a client\"},\"invite\":{\"reviewLabel\":\"Review the post before publishing\",\"reviewHelp\":\"The creator submits a draft, you approve it, then they publish. Left off, the creator publishes directly.\"},\"outcome\":{\"declined\":{\"label\":\"Invitation declined\",\"sub\":\"The creator declined - nothing was charged.\"},\"expired\":{\"label\":\"Expired without delivery\",\"sub\":\"Deadline passed - any escrowed funds were returned to your balance.\"},\"cancelled\":{\"label\":\"Booking cancelled\",\"sub\":\"Any escrowed funds were returned to your balance.\"},\"refunded\":{\"label\":\"Refunded to your balance\",\"sub\":\"This booking is closed - no payment went out.\"},\"disputed\":{\"label\":\"Dispute under review\",\"sub\":\"The Naano team is handling it - outcome pending.\"}},\"briefGate\":{\"title\":\"Launch your first brief\",\"body\":\"To launch your first campaign and book creators, start by creating your first brief.\",\"help\":\"It only takes a few minutes — AI, a link, or the Naano team. Then you can invite creators right away.