ared\",\"qualityPendingBody\":\"Naano is collecting the creator’s recent public posts. No personal LinkedIn connection is required.\",\"qualityEmptyCompleteTitle\":\"The latest scan finished successfully\",\"qualityEmptyCompleteBody\":\"Only reposts were found. They are excluded so the statistics represent the creator’s own work.\"},\"earnings\":{\"title\":\"Earnings\",\"sub\":\"Your creator earnings.\",\"newSub\":\"Track revenue from your paid collaborations and withdraw available funds.\",\"collaborationMode\":\"Paid collaborations\",\"availableNow\":\"Available now\",\"availableHint\":\"Ready to withdraw to your selected payout method.\",\"totalEarned\":\"Total earned\",\"totalEarnedHint\":\"{count} paid collaborations · {average} average\",\"inTransit\":\"In transit\",\"inTransitHint\":\"International transfers usually arrive within 1–7 days, depending on the destination and banking network.\",\"pendingRelease\":\"Pending release\",\"pendingHint\":\"Protected during the 14-day cooldown.\",\"paidOut\":\"Paid out\",\"paidOutHint\":\"Completed transfers to your payout accounts.\",\"trendTitle\":\"Earnings over time\",\"trendSub\":\"Net collaboration earnings from the last six months.\",\"chartLabel\":\"Monthly collaboration earnings over the last six months\",\"sixMonthTotal\":\"{amount} over 6 months\",\"withdrawTitle\":\"Withdraw earnings\",\"withdrawSub\":\"Choose where your available balance should be sent.\",\"withdrawAmountAria\":\"Withdrawal amount\",\"nextRelease\":\"Next release: {brand} on {date}.\",\"noPendingRelease\":\"No earnings are currently waiting for release.\",\"recentActivitySub\":\"Collaboration earnings, withdrawals and invoices in one place.\",\"earningsAndWithdrawals\":\"Earnings and withdrawals\",\"awaitingRelease\":\"Awaiting release\",\"invoices\":\"Invoices\",\"labelCollaboration\":\"Paid collaboration\",\"linkCopied\":\"Link copied\",\"invoicePending\":\"Invoice available after payout is processed\",\"invoicePendingShort\":\"Available 